Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.11,0:00:02.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Kikkun!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.43,0:00:06.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnFredoka\b1\fs18\1c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H000000&\bord0.5\pos(125.6,58.667)}The Secret of the Rubber Humans, datsun!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.07,0:00:07.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you all so much for coming \Nall the way out to the pyramid.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.19,0:00:08.40,Default,,0,0,0,,What brings you here today?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.50,0:00:11.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, this is something I can only talk about right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.20,0:00:12.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.38,0:00:17.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you remember? It was quite a while ago, \Nbut that rubber human project we asked Tsun-tsun to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.36,0:00:24.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, replacing famous politicians \Nwith rubber humans wearing rubber masks.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.40,0:00:26.64,Default,,0,0,0,,That turned out looking pretty spot-on, tsun!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.26,0:00:30.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I was told by some insiders that \Nthey have a consultation regarding that case.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.07,0:00:35.62,Default,,0,0,0,,The line at the joint between the neck \Nand body shows up too much, tsun.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.31,0:00:39.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Just as you guessed, \Ncan something be done about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.67,0:00:42.34,Default,,0,0,0,,A way to make the seams less noticeable, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.10,0:00:46.70,Default,,0,0,0,,In that case, \Nwhy not just make a whole-body suit?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.86,0:00:51.50,Default,,0,0,0,,The seams would be gone, \Nbut wouldn't being made entirely of rubber be way too hot?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.90,0:00:52.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, that's true too.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.22,0:00:56.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't they have those jackets \Nwith small electric fans built in nowadays?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.65,0:00:57.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Wouldn't that work?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.85,0:01:01.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Those fans are pretty loud, \Nso you'd get caught, tsun!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.93,0:01:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, some of them sound like \Na helicopter flying right next to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.37,0:01:08.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, what if we actually attach a helicopter rotor to it?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.73,0:01:10.28,Default,,0,0,0,,That's thinking outside the box, tsun!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.49,0:01:11.76,Default,,0,0,0,,That's our Papa, tsun!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.70,0:01:15.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It keeps you cool and lets you fly\Nkilling two birds with one stone!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.94,0:01:18.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, this is my first time hearing that phrase!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.80,0:01:25.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Well then, Tsun-tsun, \NI'll leave it in your hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.86,0:01:27.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ll give it a try, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.50,0:01:32.70,Default,,0,0,0,,A rubber human that's cool and can fly through the sky. \NThe birth of a new urban legend!
